# display: the compositor, the display drivers and the terminal drawn on a screen. The role of Debian's xserver-xorg.
#
# Milestone 611 (every program and crate belongs to a package). The package's name, kind, home
# and membership are provisional, the lane's proposal for calef to ratify; the format is
# helpers/packages.py's header, and notes/package-boundaries.md has the table and the reasons.

name display
kind optional
home display provisional

interface compositor

crate video_terminal

program compositor
program gpu_driver
program framebuffer_driver
program keyboard_driver
program display_terminal
